  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="40">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 40</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ smeage man symle on æghwilc wisan hu man fyrmest mæge ræd aredian, þeode to þearfe and rihtne Christendom swyþost aræran ⁊ æghwilce unlaga geornost afyllan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And constant thought shall be taken in every way how best to determine what is advisable for the public good, and how best to promote true Christianity, and to suppress with all diligence every injustice.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And smeage man symle on ælc wisan, hu man firmest mæg ræd aredian, þeode to þearfe, and rihtne Cristendom swiðost aræran ⁊ æghwilce unlaga geornost afillan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
